{"resourceIdentifier":"3214","resourceName":"CAGLAYANLAR BIOGAS PLANT","description":"Caglayanlar Biogas Plant project is a biogas to-energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by ÇAĞLAYANLAR BİYOGAZ ELEKTRİK ÜRETİM SANAYİ VE TİCARET LİMİTED ŞİRKETİ, as the Project Owner, in Mucur district, Kırsehir province, in Turkey.\r\nProject activity has three biogas engines installed at the biogas power plant, with 4.503 MWe/e. The manure produced by 625 dairy cattle and 76,200 non-dairy cattle located on neighboring farms is collected and fed into the anaerobic digesters at the project site.\r\nThe project began to generate electricity on October 16th, 2020According to Electricity Generation License, The biogas generator system has the maximum operational capacity 9.006 MWe/h. The annual feed-in electricity is estimated to be 67,545,000 kWh. While heat generated at the plant is used at the facility to warm the digesters, the electricity generated is directly fed to the national grid.","location":{"latitude":34.438764,"longitude":39.072432},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-22","endExclusive":"2022-09-22","endInclusive":"2022-09-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3214"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"MUCUR"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Çağlayanlar Biyogaz Elektrik Üretim Sanayi ve Ticaret Limited Şirketi"},{"type":"string","value":"Kırşehir, Turkey"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"615151"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","val